cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  Please cite the associated COREAD study when its final bibliographic record is
  available. This file identifies the software release and its recorded
  maintainer; it is not the complete manuscript author list.
title: COREAD multiaxis dependency and spatial reproducibility package
version: 0.2.1
date-released: '2026-11-08'
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: López-Cortés
    given-names: Andrés
abstract: >-
  Analysis code, frozen processed inputs, source data, provenance and validation
  for seven analyses of COREAD dependencies, patient alterations, single-cell
  expression, discovery and external spatial cohorts, CRC16 microbial niches and
  translational evidence. Active candidate sets are Core47, Spatial43,
  Convergent9 and Extended13.
keywords:
  - colorectal cancer
  - dependency
  - spatial transcriptomics
  - reproducibility
repository-code: https://github.com/ALC-OMICS/COREAD-Multiomics-Reproducibility
license: MIT
